      "description": "HSR Level 2 (15.5 m) \u2014 Two-Track Smooth Diagonal T Junction \u2014 At Grade. Diagonal HSR mainline with four direct smooth turning connections. All routes stay at the native HSR path height of 15.5 m. This is an at-grade junction: turning routes cross other routes at the same height. It is not a flyover and adds no train signalling or conflict simulation. New visual-review example; experimental, with actual game operation unverified.",
